28:authenticated public evidence archives as DATA only. It does not open any
29:private pathname, materialize/import engine JavaScript, run an engine or prove
30:a strict engine build. Historical source-path fields are not read locators.
31:
32:The receipt SHA is a4d3614d6d944660aaddc1fd95c8fe6ebef1d92fc0dd8607400578d9a82254de.
33:The adapter has SHA2108bf2e7eee28ecd16c7e644c0684518cbfd68219c2971d2df67b155bf4e80d;
34:the new package's Worker entry has SHA2ef280342b55c028c8e35e0f6cc98c9bf45c580134c9f0ada078815da1b3820d.
35:The engine stays outside the product package. The obsolete engine-only selector
36:in runner-node.mjs.data is not a staging authority: it omits support/errors.js.
37:
38:## Literal roles and future counts
39:
40:For EACH of source-built, installed and physically-moved:
41:
42:| Role | Literal planned identities | Per layout | All three |
43:| --- | --- | ---: | ---: |
44:| Main engine-free | C01–C09,C12,C13,C14,C17 | 13 | 39 |
45:| Main PUBLIC95 | C10,C11,C15,C16,C18 | 5 | 15 |
46:| Retained redirection | original retained role | 48 | 144 |
47:| Retained Unit2 | ALL current 50 identities, exactly once | 50 | 150 |
48:| Retained conditional | current version | 67 | 201 |
49:| Retained extension | current version | 35 | 105 |
50:| Retained arrays | current version | 12 | 36 |
51:| Retained exact-Promise N14 | current version | 12 | 36 |
52:
53:Thus 212 retained core rows/layout, 636 total; N14 adds 36, main adds 54:
54:726 proposed semantic rows, 711 engine-free and 15 PUBLIC95. These are planned
55:roles inherited from authenticated receipts, not newly executed/fully audited
56:row censuses. Deduplicate by (role, exact fixture identity, layout), not printed
57:short ID alone: different cohorts reuse C/H/S labels. Do not rerun/double-credit
58:Unit2 from both its direct fixture and a retained aggregate. Design/native OPEN
59:identities are not silently inserted into the 50 or counted as passes.
60:
61:C17 remains the unchanged NON-ASYNC guard returning the exact invoke Promise.
62:Transformed/async wrapper provenance is not promised. C11/C14 retain the v4
63:source-defined Git index header expectations; older expectations remain UNRUN.
64:Independent proposed E01–E08 are distinct and not author execution slots.
